---
// About section
---

<section id="about" class="px-6 lg:px-12 py-[120px] bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-[100px] items-center">
    <div class="relative h-[600px]">
      <div class="w-[70%] h-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_32px_64px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504052434569-70ad5836ab65?w=800&q=80" alt="Church building" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
      </div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[55%] h-[60%] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-8 border-white shadow-[0_24px_48px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438032005730-c779502df39b?w=600&q=80" alt="Community gathering" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="inline-block text-gold text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[2px] uppercase mb-4">About Our Church</span>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(36px,4vw,52px)] text-navy mb-6 leading-[1.15]">A family of believers rooted in faith</h2>
      <p class="text-text-light text-[17px] leading-relaxed mb-4">Nyaura SDA Church is a vibrant Seventh-day Adventist congregation committed to worshiping God in spirit and truth. For over 25 years, we've been a beacon of hope in our community.</p>
      <p class="text-text-light text-[17px] leading-relaxed mb-4">We believe in the transformative power of faith, the importance of community, and the hope found in God's Word. Our doors are open to all who seek spiritual growth and meaningful fellowship.</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-12 pt-12 border-t border-black/8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[42px] text-navy font-semibold font-heading">500+</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Active Members</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[42px] text-navy font-semibold font-heading">25+</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Years of Ministry</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[42px] text-navy font-semibold font-heading">15+</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Active Ministries</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
